-- based on (state, lat/lon) rules.
--
-- Migration 116 had a name-collision bug (Phoenix NY got Phoenix AZ's wrong
-- timezone). This migration uses STATE-aware lookup.
--
-- Idempotent: only updates cities where timezone != new value.

